                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2880992,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Many people are put off by the idea of having to fit a visit to the gym into their busy day.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 84.350006,
                  "from": 78.83,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881014,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "You often have to go very early or late as some gyms can get very crowded.",
