                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881031,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But with regular training, you'll see a big difference in a relatively short space of time.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 96.435,
                  "from": 91.315,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2881048,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Running has become incredibly popular in recent years. That's probably got a lot to do with the fact that it's a very accessible form of exercise. Anyone can run even if you can only run a few meters to begin with. But make sure you get the right shoes. It's worth investing in a high quality pair, and they don't come cheap.",
