                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881093,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But make sure you get the right shoes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 115.895004,
                  "from": 113.415,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881102,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's worth investing in a high quality pair, and they don't come cheap.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 120.695,
                  "from": 116.295006,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2881116,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "Another great thing about running is that you can do it at any time of day or night. The only thing that may stop you is snow and ice. Swimming is another really good way to build fitness. What attracts many people is that you can swim in an indoor pool at any time of year. On the other hand, it can be quite boring or solitary.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2881117,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Another great thing about running is that you can do it at any time of day or night.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 126.695,
