                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881136,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The only thing that may stop you is snow and ice.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 130.66,
                  "from": 127.22,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881148,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Swimming is another really good way to build fitness.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 135.70001,
                  "from": 132.34,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881158,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "What attracts many people is that you can swim in an indoor pool at any time of year.",
