                  "to": 142.02,
                  "from": 136.34,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881177,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "On the other hand, it can be quite boring or solitary.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 146.65501,
                  "from": 143.05501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2881189,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "It's hard to chat to people while you're swimming lengths. Cycling has become almost as popular as running in recent years. That's probably because as well as improving their fitness, many people say being out in the fresh air in a park or in the countryside can be fun, provided the conditions are right, of course. Only fanatics go out in the wind and rain. Yoga is a good choice for those of you looking for exercise, which focuses on developing both a healthy mind and body.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2881190,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's hard to chat to people while you're swimming lengths.",
