                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2881282,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "It's a good way of building strength, And with the right instructor, there's less chance of hurting yourself than with other more active sports. But don't expect to find it easy. It can be surprisingly challenging, especially for people who aren't very flexible. Getting a personal trainer is a good way to start your fitness program. Obviously, there can be significant costs involved.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2881283,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It's a good way of building strength, And with the right instructor, there's less chance of hurting yourself than with other more active sports.",
