                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2881351,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "But if you've got someone there to encourage you and help you achieve your goals, you're less likely to give up. Make sure you get someone with a recognized qualification, though, or you could do yourself permanent damage.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2881352,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But if you've got someone there to encourage you and help you achieve your goals, you're less likely to give up.",
                "meta": {
