                  "from": 295.86002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881548,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "One thing you can do to help yourself is to set manageable goals.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 316.405,
                  "from": 312.00497,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881562,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Be realistic, and don't push yourself too far.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 320.405,
                  "from": 316.72498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2881571,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Some people advise writing goals down, but I think it's better to have a flexible approach.",
                "meta": {
